1
00:00:02,100 --> 00:00:05,760
This bar at the bottom always shows your money.

2
00:00:05,860 --> 00:00:09,520
Balance is the cash in your account.

3
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:13,780
Equity is your balance plus or minus your open trades.

4
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:18,040
Usable Margin is what you can still trade with.

5
00:00:18,140 --> 00:00:22,310
Used Margin is what your open trades are holding.

6
00:00:22,410 --> 00:00:26,870
Net P/L shows if you are up or down right now.

7
00:00:26,970 --> 00:00:30,930
A green dot means you are connected.

8
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:34,790
This is the account you are signed in to.

9
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:38,650
Instruments — browse everything you can trade.

10
00:00:38,750 --> 00:00:42,510
Summary — all your accounts and totals in one place.

11
00:00:42,610 --> 00:00:46,370
Reports — your statements and trading history.

12
00:00:46,470 --> 00:00:50,230
ActFX — build and run automatic trading strategies.

13
00:00:50,330 --> 00:00:54,090
Living Market — see which currencies are strong or weak.

14
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:57,950
Analytics — charts and numbers about how you trade.

15
00:00:58,050 --> 00:01:02,010
Trading is the main screen you will use most.

16
00:01:02,110 --> 00:01:06,570
On the left: your instruments and their live prices.

17
00:01:06,670 --> 00:01:10,630
In the middle: the price chart.

18
00:01:10,730 --> 00:01:15,190
At the bottom: your open trades and orders.

19
00:01:15,290 --> 00:01:18,700
On the right: quick buttons for theme, panels and settings.

